@startuml
' ADDED: Proposed save flow; the API currently implements health and opportunity listing only.
title SkillSync — Browse and Save an Opportunity
autonumber

actor User
boundary "Application Interface\n(React UI)" as UI
control "Application Logic\n(OpportunityService)" as Service
entity "ORM / Data Access\n(Prisma Client)" as ORM
database "SQLite Database" as DB

note over UI,DB
  The local Express API, Vite proxy, Prisma, and SQLite are configured.
  Opportunity saving shown below remains proposed and is not implemented.
end note

User -> UI: Open Opportunities and set search/filters
UI -> Service: listOpportunities(filters)
Service -> Service: Validate and normalize filters
Service -> ORM: opportunity.findMany(where, include)
ORM -> DB: SELECT opportunities with company and skills
DB --> ORM: Matching opportunity records
ORM --> Service: Opportunities and related data
Service --> UI: Opportunity results
UI --> User: Display matching opportunities

User -> UI: Select "Save to my plan"
UI -> Service: saveOpportunity(userId, opportunityId)
Service -> Service: Resolve student's profile
Service -> ORM: studentProfile.findUnique(userId)
ORM -> DB: SELECT student profile by user ID
DB --> ORM: Profile record
ORM --> Service: Profile or no result

alt Profile exists
  Service -> ORM: opportunity.findUnique(opportunityId)
  ORM -> DB: SELECT opportunity by ID
  DB --> ORM: Opportunity record or no result
  ORM --> Service: Opportunity or no result
  alt Opportunity exists
    Service -> ORM: savedOpportunity.upsert(profileId, opportunityId)
    ORM -> DB: INSERT save or keep existing composite-key row
    DB --> ORM: SavedOpportunity record
    ORM --> Service: Saved status
    Service --> UI: Save confirmed
    UI --> User: Show saved state
  else Opportunity not found
    Service --> UI: Not-found error
    UI --> User: Show error; do not mark as saved
  end
else Profile missing
  Service --> UI: Profile-required error
  UI --> User: Prompt to complete profile
end

@enduml
